menu "Power latch (drivers/power_latch)"

    config POWER_LATCH_RELEASE_TIMEOUT_MS
        int "Default time power_latch_release() waits for power to collapse (ms)"
        default 2000
        range 100 30000
        help
            After dropping the hold pin, how long to wait before concluding that
            power is still present - because the user is still holding the power
            button, or the board has no latch at all - and re-asserting the pin.
            A working latch collapses the rail in milliseconds; this only bounds
            the failure case (FW-LAT-005).

endmenu
